


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_bfaf6e93:


    "祥子关上屋顶的门，转过身来。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_00c9e9bf:



    voice "d/2SA_1133"
    sachiko "「唉……总之先回我房间……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_1cbd5581:



    voice "d/2SA_1134"
    sachiko "「呜哇啊啊啊！？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_53f349e1:


    "祥子的悲鸣回荡在楼梯间的拐角处。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_f59aa2a2:


    "刚转身就被扑倒的她，一屁股坐在了楼梯上。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_eff67f01:



    voice "d/2SA_1135"
    sachiko "「喂！难道要在这做啊！？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_2b666bed:



    voice "d/2MI_1244"
    miyako "「不行吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_41c6b042:


    "三分钟后问了第二次。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_e8121c19:



    voice "d/2SA_1136"
    sachiko "「所——以——说！你为什么会觉得行得通啊！？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_7185f993:



    voice "d/2MI_1245"
    miyako "「你说在屋顶会感冒，所以就进了屋子里」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_9c5e6174:



    voice "d/2SA_1137"
    sachiko "「呜哇，是白痴理论。这里只是有个屋顶好吗！我说的是回到室内！这里是屋内！连个床都没有怎么做啊！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_e217f19d:



    voice "d/2MI_1246"
    miyako "「……要求真多。没想到你还是个小公主」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_2ae30a78:


    "噗哈。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_4884ea03:



    voice "d/2SA_1138"
    sachiko "「喂，你那无奈的表情是什么意思？诶，要张床难道是奢求吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_921e4c11:



    voice "d/2MI_1247"
    miyako "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_ffff02bb:


    "圣夜子笔直的目光里毫无收手的意思。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_489fe831:


    "不知是否对此刻的对视感到不妙，祥子看向了别处。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_9571b74a:



    voice "d/2SA_1139"
    sachiko "「为什么必须现在，在这里做啊？以后还有得是机会——」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_8db6d617:



    voice "d/2MI_1248"
    miyako "「要是现在放跑了这个机会，你又会加固自己的防线」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_a5f76c8a:


    "哦，你挺了解祥子的嘛。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_ef59d213:



    voice "d/2MI_1249"
    miyako "「等你冷静下来用理论武装自己，我就束手无策了」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_774c9c75:



    voice "d/2MI_1250"
    miyako "「对不起。我很狡猾。现在有机可趁所以我打算一冲到底」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_bce9991d:


    "她说出来了。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_81c4bc95:



    voice "d/2SA_1140"
    sachiko "「唉……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_0df1ec17:


    "祥子叹了口气。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_4db92e6a:



    voice "d/2SA_1141"
    sachiko "「……对我全盘托出是要闹哪样啊你」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_8d2584e6:



    voice "d/2MI_1251"
    miyako "「不先说清楚感觉就像是趁人之危，我不喜欢」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_7578cbe7:



    voice "d/2SA_1142"
    sachiko "「这算哪门子狡猾啊，是你太傻太老实了吧」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_7b57081e:



    voice "d/2MI_1252"
    miyako "「傻？啊咧难道我又搞砸了吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_f5f45477:



    voice "d/2SA_1143"
    sachiko "「噗」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_e746f88c:


    "祥子笑喷了。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_ca860b50:



    voice "d/2SA_1144"
    sachiko "「好了，随你喜欢吧。但是只有这一次啊？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_a3bbd4e6:



    voice "d/2MI_1253"
    miyako "「！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_987fe326:


    "圣夜子的表情豁然开朗。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_e06700ab:



    voice "d/2SA_1145"
    sachiko "「这是假装被抓包了。还有让你来到地上的我应承担的责任。还有为了避免你去给校长打报告的封口费」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_81435001:


    "真会找借口。这家伙还是和以前一样麻烦。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_7913f70a:


    "不停点头的圣夜子倒是坦率得不行。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_105826db:



    voice "d/2SA_1146"
    sachiko "「……话说你这基本相当于色诱了啊？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_8e0ecd32:



    voice "d/2MI_1254"
    miyako "「是的。我很庆幸自己选了这张脸」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_56fa66ce:


    "哦，多谢夸奖。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_3a517b56:



    voice "d/2SA_1147"
    sachiko "「那么，就由姐姐我来教你……诶诶？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_348dc790:



    voice "d/2MI_1255"
    miyako "「呼呼！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_42bc6af6:


    "圣夜子喘着粗气，猛地压倒了祥子。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_35efb0fa:



    voice "d/2SA_1148"
    sachiko "「等、我是受！？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_f8c7e66a:



    voice "d/2MI_1256"
    miyako "「是的，我想攻。不行吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_c6d90f1b:


    "五分钟后问了第三次。再次动用了眼神和美色。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_665cc92a:



    voice "d/2SA_1149"
    sachiko "「服了你了……事已至此就随你喜欢吧……你会做吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_ec232495:



    voice "d/2MI_1257"
    miyako "「见识不少了没关系的！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_0ae60567:



    voice "d/2SA_1150"
    sachiko "「呜哇，超令人不安的发言……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_be244ef8:


    "暂且相信她。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_5f3bdc8f:



    voice "d/2MI_1258"
    miyako "「和乃绘瑠同学的时候是怎样的？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_a992fa21:


    "她问得很直接。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_f1db52db:



    voice "d/2SA_1151"
    sachiko "「呃那……当然是我攻咯。而且还是很机灵地领导了她」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_e2a4bc06:


    "嚯嚯。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_d56f3299:



    voice "d/2MI_1259"
    miyako "「乃绘瑠同学说你的爱抚都很小心翼翼」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_2a0ceaa3:



    voice "d/2SA_1152"
    sachiko "「唔咕！那家伙……明明“要死了要死了”地喘个不停」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_877a3375:


    "不不那个是别的意思……是真的要死了！"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_76d8721d:



    voice "d/2MI_1260"
    miyako "「那我开始了」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_de0b0aa7:



    voice "d/2SA_1153"
    sachiko "「感觉好害羞啊，呃……唔喔！？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_a6f3bb86:


    "圣夜子突然卷起了祥子的衣服。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_29398b16:



    voice "d/2SA_1154"
    sachiko "「等等等等等等！考虑一下氛围和心理准备吧——！！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_2c23b6f7:



    voice "d/2MI_1261"
    miyako "「好瘦……要好好吃饭啊」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_21a88d87:


    "圣夜子一边摸着祥子的腹部，一边对她的消瘦感到担心。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_eae0693f:



    voice "d/2SA_1155"
    sachiko "「你这乱来与温柔的二重攻击算啥啦！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_8624bfa3:



    voice "d/2MI_1262"
    miyako "「……好美」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_2f41730a:


    "圣夜子抚摸着祥子全身所有角落，就像是在确认祥子的一切。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_9fc20712:



    voice "d/2SA_1156"
    sachiko "「唔……所以说你这已经是色诱了吧……唔噢！？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_561e3676:


    "四分钟后用了第二次。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_635f928b:


    "卷起T恤与胸罩后，圣夜子又以迅雷不及掩耳之势脱光了祥子的下半身。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_fc04c629:


    "她这一系列行为与她游说祥子时一样充满情热。都是纯真无垢的冲动。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_6f110859:



    voice "d/2MI_1263"
    miyako "「冷不冷？害不害羞？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_0a7170ef:



    voice "d/2SA_1157"
    sachiko "「这种事脱之前问啊！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_33d3eea4:



    voice "d/2MI_1264"
    miyako "「原来如此」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_296f1bd9:



    voice "d/2SA_1158"
    sachiko "「话说，你难道不觉得害羞？明明是这个场合这个姿势？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_6a5b8283:



    voice "d/2MI_1265"
    miyako "「我很害羞！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_cd841a72:



    voice "d/2SA_1159"
    sachiko "「你这家伙——！！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_268620b9:


    "祥子还没来得及一脚踹飞圣夜子，圣夜子就已经把脸埋进了脱光的那里。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_d091830c:



    voice "d/2MI_1266"
    miyako "「接触的舌头能够感受到你……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_0898198c:


    "圣夜子的舌尖一点点……舔到了裂缝。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_80dd434b:



    voice "d/2SA_1161"
    sachiko "「嗯……咕……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_102f9044:


    "被圣夜子晃动的刘海拂过下腹，祥子的表情变了。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_d72eeae4:



    voice "d/2MI_1267"
    miyako "「要更……激烈一些？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_de774c7a:


    "圣夜子抬头看向祥子。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_20d1f71e:



    voice "d/2MI_1268"
    miyako "「……像、像这样吗？嗯嗯……呲溜！呲溜！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_7cafb3ed:


    "圣夜子噘着嘴吸吮。但每一次刺激的时间都太短，大概不会引发快感。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_3bfbb546:



    voice "d/2MI_1269"
    miyako "「……咳咳、咳！！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_95c2c7b9:


    "圣夜子大概是被自己的唾液呛到了。为了咽下唾液，她的喉咙上下蠕动着。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_450934d0:



    voice "d/2SA_1162"
    sachiko "「……唔」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_1023c3f9:



    voice "d/2MI_1270"
    miyako "「痛、痛吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_6c133ece:



    voice "d/2SA_1163"
    sachiko "「不……不是。那里……很舒服」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_9376df96:



    voice "d/2MI_1271"
    miyako "「诶……是这里吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_43454601:


    "圣夜子好像很高兴。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_1fd36a0a:



    voice "d/2SA_1160"
    sachiko "「唔啊……嗯！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_d300c694:



    voice "d/2MI_1272"
    miyako "「啊哈……发出了奇怪的声音」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_c347bb4b:



    voice "d/2SA_1164"
    sachiko "「这……不是当然的嘛」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_1f2285c7:



    voice "d/2MI_1273"
    miyako "「……感觉很开心」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_77b0dbad:



    voice "d/2SA_1165"
    sachiko "「技术挺好的，就这样……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_9df6f7e0:



    voice "d/2MI_1274"
    miyako "「呲溜、呲溜……呲呲……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_83fe1d64:


    "圣夜子被夸技术好后似乎心情大好，动作一下子变得激烈起来。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_4757340d:



    voice "d/2MI_1275"
    miyako "「我……会努力的！就这样拼命做！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_b3108115:



    voice "d/2SA_1166"
    sachiko "「等……不、不用拼命啦！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_29024481:



    voice "d/2MI_1276"
    miyako "「唔咕……好，我知道……更激烈一点是吧！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_88ed852b:



    voice "d/2SA_1167"
    sachiko "「痛……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_a9734bc1:



    voice "d/2SA_1168"
    sachiko "「你真是随心所欲啊……现在终于能意识到，我当时……是胆小鬼了」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_a6d9a7e1:



    voice "d/2SA_1169"
    sachiko "「哈哈。乃绘瑠说不定对要去不去的状态很恼火吧」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_b4040e5a:


    "同时也一定是感到了你的温柔。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_aa12bfc2:


    "温柔与焦急，很配吧。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_ae0e34e8:


    "毕竟“祥子×乃绘瑠”与“圣夜子×祥子”也是完全对称的。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_20058f24:



    voice "d/2SA_1170"
    sachiko "「……你的爱情表现很直率啊」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_724afbd1:


    "祥子通过肌肤感受着圣夜子的爱情。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_27e791e6:



    voice "d/2MI_1277"
    miyako "「你说什么了？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_f8171f43:



    voice "d/2SA_1171"
    sachiko "「嗯……没有。话说！吸那么用力会痛的啦！你是婴儿吗！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_5dc9475c:



    voice "d/2MI_1278"
    miyako "「啊……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_e5657f29:



    voice "d/2SA_1172"
    sachiko "「终止了，终止！那里还火辣辣地疼！」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_f2a94e78:



    voice "d/2MI_1279"
    miyako "「对不起……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_8c4f4362:



    voice "d/2SA_1173"
    sachiko "「唉……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_be74228d:


    "祥子深深叹了口气。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_f9e0b2ee:



    voice "d/2SA_1174"
    sachiko "「喂，我才刚说完要慢慢来吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_434b03b2:



    voice "d/2MI_1280"
    miyako "「诶嘿嘿，抱歉啦」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_fa2194f9:


    "感觉不到她的内疚反省。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_858a5f64:



    voice "d/2SA_1175"
    sachiko "「虽然做都做完了再说有些奇怪，我们还不是……」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_6c190ec7:



    voice "d/2MI_1281"
    miyako "「我知道的。慢慢来对吧」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_69b52a70:


    "明显是不知道。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_693d241c:



    voice "d/2MI_1282"
    miyako "「但是人生短暂，得赶快让你喜欢上我啊」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_ac171eeb:



    voice "d/2SA_1176"
    sachiko "「……抱歉」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_c1648bd7:



    voice "d/2MI_1283"
    miyako "「我会拉住你的手的」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_4a5af3b3:


    "圣夜子直视着祥子的双瞳，紧紧握住了她的手。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_00716ac2:


    "眼神里传达出强烈的爱意。"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_3b35ebea:



    voice "d/2MI_1284"
    miyako "「怎么了？」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_9bfadce2:



    voice "d/2SA_1177"
    sachiko "「啊啊。被爱真的很不妙。不受控制的感情似乎要满溢而出了」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_67e0631d:



    voice "d/2MI_1285"
    miyako "「哭出来也没问题哦」"


translate simplified_chinese rp_c_scene07_e035ff84:



    voice "d/2SA_1178"
    sachiko "「……我才不要」"
